    "updated_at": "2018-04-10T12:21:18Z",
    "body": "And on a related note the algorithm uses \"If sequence[s] is undefined\" as well as loop controls like \"if s is less than length\".\r\n\r\nI'm guessing \"If sequence[s] is undefined\"  is equivalent to \"s >= length\" but this isn't made explicit anywhere. ",
